K3V GBA licensing
=================

K3V-authored source changes and build tooling are offered under
GPL-3.0-or-later unless a file states otherwise.

The repository incorporates third-party components under GPL-2.0,
GPL-2.0-or-later, GPL-3.0-or-later, MIT, the Analogue Pocket Framework
license, and Intel/Altera IP terms. Each file retains its controlling notice.

Complete commonly used license texts are in LICENSES/. Analogue APF and
Intel/Altera files retain their full notices in their source headers.

No license is granted to Nintendo firmware, BIOS images, games, trademarks,
or other assets not included in this repository.
